1
00:00:00,714 --> 00:00:02,184
- May I join you, Leonard?
- Sure.

2
00:00:02,349 --> 00:00:03,749
(Penny(off):)Thanks.

3
00:00:04,518 --> 00:00:06,218
(Leonard:)Hey, Alex, let me ask you something.

4
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:10,980
(Leonard:)My girlfriend knows this guy at school.
He's got an English accent...

5
00:00:11,158 --> 00:00:12,918
(Alex:)Ooh, I love English accents.

6
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:15,490
(Leonard:)Yeah, you all do.

7
00:00:16,496 --> 00:00:18,696
(Leonard:)Anyway, I feel like he's hitting on her.

8
00:00:18,865 --> 00:00:21,495
(Leonard:)She says he's just being nice
and I should trust her.

9
00:00:21,668 --> 00:00:23,498
(Alex:)It's probably harmless.

10
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:27,130
(Alex:)You know how it is.
I'm sure you get hit on all the time.

11
00:00:29,009 --> 00:00:30,839
(Leonard:)Right.

12
00:00:31,678 --> 00:00:35,008
(Leonard:)Because girls are always like,
"Ooh, that guy owns two Star Trek uniforms...

13
00:00:35,182 --> 00:00:39,172
(Leonard:)...and gets a lot of ear infections.
I gotta get me some of that."

14
00:00:40,754 --> 00:00:43,084
(Raj:)I don't know.
Bet it happens more than you realize.

15
00:00:43,256 --> 00:00:44,516
(Leonard:)Trust me, it doesn't.

16
00:00:44,691 --> 00:00:46,021
(Raj:)You sure?

17
00:00:46,193 --> 00:00:47,923
(Alex:)You're cute, you're funny.

18
00:00:48,094 --> 00:00:50,924
(Alex:)Maybe you're getting hit on
and you don't even know it.

19
00:00:53,366 --> 00:00:54,696
(Leonard:)Really?

20
00:00:54,868 --> 00:01:03,018
(Leonard:)I'm pretty sure.

